{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rom-4-1","title":"Romans 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Abraham's faith was imputed to him for righteousness; 10 before he was circumcised. 13 By faith only he and his seed received the promise. 16 Abraham is the father of all that believe. 24 Our faith also shall be imputed to us for righteousness.</p>\n<p>what. 6:1; 7:7; 8:31 Abraham. Isa 51:2; Mt 3:9; Lu 3:8; 16:24,25,29-31; Joh 8:33,37-41,53,56 Ac 13:26; 2Co 11:22 as pertaining. 16; Heb 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-2","title":"Romans 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Abraham. 3:20-28; Php 3:9 he hath. 3:27; 15:17; Eze 8:9; Jer 9:23,24; 1Co 9:16; 2Co 5:12; 11:12,30 2Co 12:1-9; Ga 6:13,14; Eph 2:9 but. Ge 12:12,13,18,20; 20:9-13; Jos 24:2; 1Co 1:29; 4:7; Ga 3:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-3","title":"Romans 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>what. 9:17; 10:11; 11:2; Isa 8:20; Mr 12:10; Jas 4:5; 2Pe 1:20,21 Abraham. Ge 15:6; Ga 3:6-8; Jas 2:23 counted. 5,9,11,22-25; Ps 106:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-4","title":"Romans 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>9:32; 11:6,35; Mt 20:1-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-5","title":"Romans 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>But to. 24,25; 3:22; 5:1,2; 10:3,9,10; Ac 13:38,39; Ga 2:16,17; 3:9-14 Php 3:9 believeth. 24; 3:26-30; 8:30-34; Joh 5:24; Ga 3:8 ungodly. 1:17,18; 5:6-8; Jos 24:2; Zec 3:3,4; 1Co 6:9-11; 1Ti 1:13-15 Tit 3:3-7 his faith. 3; Hab 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-6","title":"Romans 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>blessedness. 9; De 33:29; Ps 1:1-3; 112:1; 146:5,6; Mt 5:3-12; Ga 3:8,9,14; 4:15 Eph 1:3 imputeth. 11,24; 1:17; 3:22; 5:18,19; Isa 45:24,25; 54:17; Jer 22:6; 33:16 Da 9:24; 1Co 1:30; 2Co 5:21; Php 3:9; 2Pe 1:1 without. 3:20,21,27; Eph 2:8-10; 2Ti 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-7","title":"Romans 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Ps 32:1,2; 51:8,9; 85:2; 130:3,4; Isa 40:1,2; Jer 33:8,9 Mic 7:18-20; Mt 9:2; Lu 7:47-50</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-8","title":"Romans 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>to whom. Isa 53:10-12; 2Co 5:19-20; Phm 1:18,19; 1Pe 2:24; 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-9","title":"Romans 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Cometh. 3:29,30; 9:23,24; 10:12,13; 15:8-19; Isa 49:6; Lu 2:32 Ga 3:14,26-28; Eph 2:11-13; 3:8; Col 3:11 for we. 3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-10","title":"Romans 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>not in circumcision.\"Faith was reckoned to Abraham for righteousness,\" at least 14 years before he was circumcised; the former having taken place some time before Ishmael's birth, at which time he was 86 years old, and the other when Ishmael was 13 years of age, and Abraham 99.</p>\n<p>Ge 15:5,6,16; 16:1-3; 17:1,10,23-27; 1Co 7:18,19; Ga 5:6; 6:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-11","title":"Romans 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the sign. Ge 17:10; Ex 12:13; 31:13,17; Eze 20:12,20 a seal. 2:28,29; De 30:6; 2Co 1:22; Eph 1:13; 4:30; Re 9:4 righteousness. 13; 3:22; 9:30; 10:6; Ga 5:5; Php 3:9; Heb 11:7; 2Pe 1:1 father. 12,16-18; 3:22,26; 9:6,33; 10:4,11; Mt 8:11; 16:16; Lu 19:9 Joh 3:15,16,36; 6:35,40,40,47; 7:38,39; 8:33; 11:25,26 Ga 3:7,22,29; 6:16 that righteousness. 6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-12","title":"Romans 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>to them. 9:6,7; Mt 3:9; Lu 16:23-31; Joh 8:39,40; Ga 4:22-31 in the steps. Job 33:11; Pr 2:20; So 1:8; 2Co 12:18; 1Pe 2:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-13","title":"Romans 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>For the. Ge 12:3; 17:4,5,16; 22:17,18; 28:14; 49:10; Ps 2:8; 72:11 through the. Ga 3:16-18,29 but through. 11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-14","title":"Romans 4:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>For if. 16; Ga 2:21; 3:18-24; 5:4; Php 3:9; Heb 7:19,28 made. 3:31; Nu 30:12,15; Ps 119:126; Isa 55:11; Jer 19:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-15","title":"Romans 4:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Because. 1:17; 2:5,6; 3:19,20; 5:13,20,21; 7:7-11; Nu 32:14; De 29:20-28 2Ki 22:13; Jer 4:8; La 2:22; Eze 7:19; Zep 1:18; Joh 3:36; 15:22 Ac 17:30,31; 1Co 15:56; 2Co 3:7-9; Ga 3:10,19; Eph 5:6; Col 3:6 1Jo 3:4; Re 6:16,17; 19:15 where. 2:12,13; 5:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-16","title":"Romans 4:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>of faith. 3:24-26; 5:1; Ga 3:7-12,22; Eph 2:5,8; Tit 3:7 the promise. Heb 6:13-19; 2Pe 1:10 but to. 11 the father. 9:8; Isa 51:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-17","title":"Romans 4:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I have. Ge 17:4,5,16,20; 25:1-34; 28:3; Heb 11:12 before him. or, like unto him. 3:29 who quickeneth. 2; 8:11; Mt 3:9; Joh 5:21,25; 6:63; 1Co 15:45; Eph 2:1-5; 1Ti 6:13 calleth. 8:29,30; 9:26; Isa 43:6; 44:7; 49:12; 55:12; Ac 15:18; 1Co 1:28 Heb 11:7; 1Pe 2:10; 2Pe 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-18","title":"Romans 4:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>against. 19; 5:5; 8:24; Ru 1:11-13; Pr 13:12; Eze 37:11; Mr 5:35,36; Lu 1:18 Ac 27:25 So shall. Ge 15:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-19","title":"Romans 4:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>being. 20,21; 14:21; Mt 6:30; 8:26; 14:31; Mr 9:23,24; Joh 20:27,28 considered. Ge 17:17; 18:11-14; Heb 11:11-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-20","title":"Romans 4:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>staggered. Nu 11:13-23; 2Ki 7:2,19; 2Ch 20:15-20; Isa 7:9; Jer 32:16-27 Lu 1:18,45 but was. Isa 35:4; Da 10:19; 11:32; Hag 2:4; Zec 8:9,13; 1Co 16:13; 2Co 12:10 Eph 6:10; 2Ti 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-21","title":"Romans 4:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>fully. 8:38; 2Ti 1:12; Heb 11:13 he was able. 14:4; Ge 18:14; Ps 115:3; Jer 32:17,27; Mt 19:26; Lu 1:37,45 2Co 9:8; Heb 11:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-22","title":"Romans 4:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>it was imputed. 3,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-23","title":"Romans 4:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>15:4; 1Co 9:10; 10:6,11; 2Ti 3:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-24","title":"Romans 4:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>for us. Ac 2:39 if we. 10:9,10; Mr 16:16; Joh 3:14-16; Ac 2:24; 13:30; Eph 1:18-20 Heb 13:20,21; 1Pe 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-4-25","title":"Romans 4:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Who was. 3:25; 5:6-8; 8:3,32; Isa 53:5,6,10-12; Da 9:24,26; Zec 13:7 Mt 20:28; 1Co 15:3,4; 2Co 5:21; Ga 1:4; 3:13; Eph 5:2; Tit 2:14 Heb 9:28; 1Pe 1:18,19; 2:24; 3:18; 1Jo 2:2; 4:9,10; Re 1:5; 5:9; 7:14 and was raised. 8:33,34; 1Co 15:17; Heb 4:14-16; 10:12-14; 1Pe 1:21</p>"}]}